1. Target contract (one paragraph)
In your own words, state:

the unit (one de-identified structure / DINS inspection);
the label serious_damage (Major or Destroyed = 1; No Damage, Affected, Minor = 0);
the conditioning: the structure was inspected in or near a wildfire perimeter;
what this number is not (not annual household risk, not a premium, not a coverage decision).
